WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:07,870
Is everyone here? Is everything done? 1-3

2
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:09,540
Done

3
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,100
What's going on

4
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,100
Li Dajun and the others wanted to squeeze into our car, but they didn't agree.

5
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:26,100
Later there was chaos again.

6
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:29,650
Don't let people you can't trust join.

7
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:32,650
Mom and little sister did right by little

8
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:34,650
I'll drive it for you after I finish eating

9
00:00:34,650 --> 00:00:35,650
Little girl, don't stay up late

10
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:36,650
I can do it

11
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:38,650
I'll tell you in advance when I'm tired

12
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:39,650
You guys rest first

13
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:42,350
Then I'll feed you two mouthfuls

14
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:44,480
Thank you, Sister Wang

15
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,480
I just ate steamed buns and tea eggs. I’m not hungry.
